# Atheros QCA6174 (168c:003e) on the Coral Dev Board, reached over pcie0.
# ath10k asks for the highest firmware API it finds, so only the API 6 blob
# is needed; board-2.bin is selected by board id, board.bin is its fallback.
# The sdio firmware and the other API notices are for variants we do not have.
ath10k/QCA6174/hw3.0/firmware-6.bin
ath10k/QCA6174/hw3.0/board-2.bin
ath10k/QCA6174/hw3.0/board.bin
ath10k/QCA6174/hw3.0/notice_ath10k_firmware-6.txt
